From 7cb100d0caa060d18ad36b24844ab680ffb30491 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:29:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] MAINTAINERS: track MSM8926 CPU calibration helpers

Extend the existing CPR and CPUfreq ownership patterns to cover the new
private calibration helpers and shared eligibility headers.

The complete series now provides every referenced header and consumer.
Retain the existing Qualcomm CPR and cpufreq owners and mailing lists.

Backport as part of the initial maintained-6.18.63 CPU stack. The complete
series passes 45 selected host test methods. Standalone executables use
ASan, UBSan and normal LeakSanitizer; ctypes numerical oracles are
explicitly unsanitized. Twenty selected objects compile with the feature
enabled and disabled on ARM, ARM64 and ARM64 RT (120 objects), W=1 and
nonpermissive CFI, with no diagnostics. ARM32 RT is unsupported.

Original author/date and source notices are preserved. Codex prepared
this local backport and verification. Original scoped source provenance
remains recorded in the review evidence. Human review and DCO remain
pending; no phone, publication or maintainer action has occurred.

Backported from commit 1d921d51748bcf8c37a478092d2e6c15c771091e
("MAINTAINERS: track MSM8926 CPU calibration helpers")
---
 MAINTAINERS | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 012e86db67d6..e6bf0757aa2b 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -21127,7 +21127,9 @@ L:	linux-pm@vger.kernel.org
 L:	linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org
 S:	Maintained
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/avs/qcom,cpr.yaml
+F:	drivers/pmdomain/qcom/cpr*.h
 F:	drivers/pmdomain/qcom/cpr.c
+F:	include/linux/soc/qcom/cpr.h
 
 QUALCOMM CPUCP MAILBOX DRIVER
 M:	Sibi Sankar <sibi.sankar@oss.qualcomm.com>
@@ -21143,6 +21145,7 @@ S:	Maintained
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpufreq/qcom-cpufreq-nvmem.yaml
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/opp/opp-v2-kryo-cpu.yaml
 F:	drivers/cpufreq/qcom-cpufreq-nvmem.c
+F:	include/dt-bindings/opp/qcom,msm8926.h
 
 QUALCOMM CRYPTO DRIVERS
 M:	Thara Gopinath <thara.gopinath@gmail.com>
